# Advanced Alert Correlation Insights

## Correlation Drift

Occurs when correlation rules become less effective over time due to:

- Changes in attacker behavior
- Infrastructure modifications
- New attack techniques

---

## Correlation Evasion Techniques

Methods attackers use to avoid detection:

- Spreading activities over time
- Using multiple accounts
- Modifying attack patterns
- Blending with normal user behavior

---

# Benefits of Alert Correlation

- Reduces alert fatigue
- Improves incident detection accuracy
- Enhances threat visibility
- Accelerates investigations
- Supports threat hunting

---

# Key Takeaway

Alert Correlation helps SOC analysts connect isolated alerts, identify real security incidents, and respond to threats more effectively.